Association StaffEducationOrganizationAssignmentAssociation
    documentation 'This association indicates the education organization to which a staff member 
    'provides services; also known as school of service.
    domain entity Staff
        documentation 'The Staff assigned to the EducationOrganization.
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation 'The EducationalOrganization to which the Staff member provides services.
    descriptor StaffClassification
        documentation 'The titles of employment, official status, or rank of education staff.
        is part of identity
    string PositionTitle
        documentation 'The descriptive name of an individual's position.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 100
    date BeginDate
		documentation 'Month, day, and year of the start or effective date of a staff member's 
		'employment, contract, or relationship with the LEA.
        is part of identity
	date EndDate
		documentation 'Month, day, and year of the end or termination date of a staff member's 
		'employment, contract, or relationship with the LEA.
        is optional
    integer OrderOfAssignment
		documentation 'Describes whether the assignment is this the staff member's primary assignment, 
		'secondary assignment, etc.
        is optional
    reference StaffEducationOrganizationEmploymentAssociation
        documentation 'A reference to the employment association.
        is optional
        with context StaffEducationOrganizationEmploymentAssociation shorten to Employment
        merge StaffEducationOrganizationEmploymentAssociation.Staff with Staff

